                <head>Reciprocal trade agreement between the United States and Switzerland, signed
                    January 9, 1936<anchor n="1" xml:id="ch42-f1"/></head>
                <p>[For text of the agreement, see Department of State Executive Agreement Series
                    No. 90, or 49 Stat. 3917. Notes exchanged on the date of signature of the
                    agreement are printed <hi rendition="#italic">infra</hi>. A supplementary
                    agreement was effected by an exchange of notes, July 9 and 11, 1936 (not
                    printed), regarding marks to be placed on watches and watch movements
                    (611.5431/461).]</p>





